  "onboarding.you.saved-failed": "Your name could not be saved just now, so this step is asking again rather than pretending it worked.",
  "onboarding.language.settled": "You have already chosen this, so nothing here needs answering. Account settings is where it changes.",
  // 2 — Path. The two entry modes, which converge on the same product.
