  // The digits are NOT here. `404` is a machine-readable code, which §5b puts
  // out of scope, and a key nobody could translate is a key a translator would
  // eventually translate.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // The sign-in screen.
  //
  // THE LAST UNTRANSLATED SURFACE IN THE PRODUCT, and it was the one that most
  // needed translating. Every other screen in `apps/app` reads from this
