  // the view of the work and never the work. That is the half a customer needs,
  // and a translator must keep it as blunt as the English.
  "studio.restore.unavailable": "Anything built here before could not be loaded, because the build service did not answer. Nothing has been lost: a site is saved away from this screen.",
