  "account.devices.outcome.malformed": "That request did not name a device we could act on, so nothing changed.",
  // The file preview. Unlike the three surfaces before it, the coverage scan read
  // this one correctly: 16 of 16. The blind spots cluster where CONDITIONAL prose
